ick lookup using print().\n\nto_nested() have been added to convert the dictionary to a nested\ndictionary with the correct structure for the specified binary.', 'title': 'ase.io.espresso.Namelist', 'url': 'https://docs.ase-lib.org/ase/calculators/espresso.html#ase.io.espresso.Namelist', 'source': 'ase', 'metadata': {'source': 'ase', 'module': 'ase.calculators.espresso', 'qualified_name': 'ase.io.espresso.Namelist', 'kind': 'class', 'name': 'Namelist', 'class': 'Namelist', 'chunk_index': 0, 'num_chunks': 1}, 'score': 2.473780632019043, 'vector_score': 0.45156148076057434, 'bm25_score': 19.061342412168898, 'rerank_score': 2.473780632019043}]}

